.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confused\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Confused</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">hostile</a> to everyone, wanders around aimlessly, and occasionally skips turns in its stupor</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Insanity's_Kiss\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Insanity's Kiss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\">Insanity's Kiss</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to all other creatures for the condition's duration.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Madness\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Madness</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to everyone in the vicinity.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202322\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4716/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82721/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21013/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion d